{"id":"confianza","lemma":"confianza","pos":"noun","rank":917,"glosses":["confidence, trust"],"ipa":"/konˈfjanθa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"confianzas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-confianza.wav","examples":[{"text":"Le digo esto en confianza.","en":"I'm telling you this confidentially.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594633","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"I mean"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Él no es de confianza.","en":"He cannot be relied on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636733","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Perdí mi confianza en él.","en":"I lost my trust in him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/36312","words":[{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"he"}]},{"text":"Ten confianza en ti mismo.","en":"Have confidence in yourself.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"you","l":"tú"},{"g":"same"}]},{"text":"He perdido la confianza en usted.","en":"I've lost faith in you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460869","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"you (formal)"}]}]}